print("A skill that comes with the lamp, comfort-break, has fired (someone has sat at the desk a long while, an hour and a half or more, with nobody else in view). What the lamp says now: one short, light line, the way a friend would, that it is a good moment for a short break; name no place and no reason, and nothing about health. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
